From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alfred Ben <e0958604@u.nus.edu>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 17:24:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] explore: keep the call graph safe under concurrent
 sessions

Follow-ups to the combined growth, footprint and shared-server changes.

- back both call-graph arenas with page_allocator, so the warm footprint
  does not regress; the call-graph helpers no longer take an allocator
- retire the approximate call graph on an exact upgrade instead of
  freeing it under a shared lock while other sessions read it
- publish and read the call graph and call centrality under one lock;
  callpath uses only an exact graph
